    {
      "id": "6ad927e000000000000cb116",
      "text": "\t[zeta]なるものが流行ってるらしい、韓国のAIチャットサービス",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792616417,
      "updated": 1792616427
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad928cd00000000000cb11b",
      "text": "\t\thttps://zeta-ai.io/ja",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792616654,
      "updated": 1792616654
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad928d500000000000cb11d",
      "text": "\t\t[https://gyazo.com/368afe97472957c42a61a285779c7687]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792616662,
      "updated": 1792616662
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad927ec00000000000cb117",
      "text": "\t\t立ち絵つきでチャットしていくと展開がそうなっていく感じ",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792616429,
      "updated": 1792616528
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad928d700000000000cb11e",
      "text": "\t\t\tなるほど、キャラの心の声も見えるので展開を考えやすい",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792616664,
      "updated": 1792616672
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad9283a00000000000cb118",
      "text": "\t\t独自モデルなのか、すごいな",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
